# The commands of a battle, in 1st Manassas (BULLRUN1.CIV) as the Confederate side: the help
# (F1), the Game Options of F3 (Order of Battle, Game Score, Briefing, Screen Redraw), the hot
# keys (View, Terrain, Join, Order of battle, Game score, Quiet, Recon, Screen redraw,
# Intelligence), the Unit Command menu, a move order with the cursor, Charge, an artillery
# battery's Fire, Limber and Unlimber, Wait, and a move by an arrow key. Then F10 ends the battle
# at the main menu, and the game quits.
#! seed 1
#! timeout 600

# Pauses that any key ends; the combat menu: Light Skirmish; Pursue ? and Stack Units: No.
rule 1 key space
rule 2:C key enter
rule 2:P key enter
rule 2:S key enter

# Main menu, Load File; BULLRUN1.CIV in the list; Fight.
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key right
prompt
key enter
play until 2:M
digest
key enter

# The first command: Cocke, infantry. F1, the help, which a key ends.
play until 5
digest
key f1
prompt
digest
key space

# F3, Game Options: Order of Battle, its pages; Game Score; Briefing; Screen Redraw; Esc.
play until 5
key f3
prompt
digest
text o
prompt
digest
key space
play until 5
digest
key f3
prompt
text g
prompt
digest
key space
play until 5
key f3
prompt
text b
prompt
digest
key space
play until 5
key f3
prompt
text s
play until 5
digest
key f3
prompt
key esc

# The hot keys. V: the line of sight, which a key ends.
play until 5
text v
prompt
digest
key space
# T: the terrain alone, and J: the units this one may join; both show for a moment.
play until 5
digest
text t
play until 5
text j
play until 5
digest
# O: the order of battle. G: the game score.
text o
prompt
digest
key space
play until 5
text g
prompt
key space
# Q and R toggle the sound and the recon mode; each twice.
play until 5
text q
prompt
digest
text q
prompt
text r
prompt
digest
text r
prompt
# S: the screen redrawn. I: intelligence, the cursor moved over two hexes, Esc.
text s
play until 5
text i
prompt
digest
key right
prompt
key right
prompt
digest
key esc
# Enter: the Unit Command menu, Esc.
play until 5
key enter
prompt
digest
key esc
# Move to location: the cursor two hexes to the right, Enter.
play until 5
key enter
prompt
text m
prompt
key right
prompt
key right
prompt
digest
key enter
play until 5
digest
# C: charge. Next is Walton, a Napoleon battery.
text c
play until 5
digest
# F: fire. Enter at the battery's own hex finds no enemy there and gives the cursor again; Esc.
text f
prompt
digest
key enter
prompt
digest
key esc
# L: limber; the battery's turn ends.
play until 5
text l
# Wheat, infantry: W, wait.
play until 5
digest
text w
# Cocke, charging: an arrow key moves him one hex.
play until 5
digest
key left
# Walton, limbered: F asks to unlimber first. Yes.
play until 5
digest
text f
prompt
digest
text y
play until 5
digest

# F10: back to the main menu. Quit, Yes, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
key f10
play until 2:M
digest
text q
prompt
digest
text y
repeat space
